      "title" : "Dutch Pharmacogenetics Working Group (DPWG) guideline for the gene-drug interaction between SLCO1B1 and statins and CYP2C9 and sulfonylureas.",
      "_sameAs" : "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/39676086",
