    "pediatricMarkdown" : {
      "id" : 1451266780,
      "html" : "<p>Guideline excerpt: &quot;At the time of this writing, data on the possible role of DPYD genetic variation in 5-fluorouracil toxicity in pediatric patient populations are extremely scarce; however, there is no evidence to suggest that 5-fluorouracil pharmacokinetics differ from adult patients and thus no evidence that DPYD variants would affect 5-fluorouracil metabolism differently in children.&quot;</p>\\n",
      "version" : 0
