    "summaryMarkdown" : {
      "id" : 1450415337,
      "html" : "<p>There are currently no dosing recommendations for quetiapine based on CYP2D6 genotype.</p>\\n",
      "version" : 0
    },
    "terms" : [],
    "textMarkdown" : {
      "id" : 1450415338,
      "html" : "<h3 id=\\"dutch-pharmacogenetics-working-group-dpwg-guideline-for-the-gene-drug-interaction-between-cyp2d6-cyp3a4-and-cyp1a2-and-antipsychotics-european-journal-of-human-genetics-2023\\">Dutch Pharmacogenetics Working Group (DPWG) guideline for the gene-drug interaction between CYP2D6, CYP3A4 and CYP1A2 and antipsychotics.  European journal of human genetics (2023)</h3>\\n<p>The Royal Dutch Pharmacists Association - Pharmacogenetics Working Group published a paper with the guidelines for quetiapine and CYP2D6 as per the November 2018 guidelines and further details on the assessed literature [Article:<a href=\\"/pmid/37002327\\">37002327</a>]. Supplementary Table 10H: &quot;Suggested clinical decision support texts for health care professionals for CYP2D6-quetiapine&quot; states for CYP2D6 UM, IM, PM - quetiapine pairs &quot;This is NOT a gene-drug interaction.&quot;</p>\\n<h3 id=\\"november-2018-guideline\\">November 2018 Guideline</h3>\\n<p>The Royal Dutch Pharmacists Association - Pharmacogenetics Working Group has evaluated therapeutic dose recommendations for quetiapine based on CYP2D6 genotypes. They conclude that this is not a gene-drug interaction. <em>See the <a download=\\"DPWG_November_2018.pdf\\" href=\\"https://api.clinpgx.org/v1/download/file/attachment/DPWG_November_2018.pdf\\">Dutch guidelines November 2018 update</a>.</em></p>\\n<p><a download=\\"DPWG_CYP2D6_quetiapine_2393-2394-2395.pdf\\" href=\\"https://api.clinpgx.org/v1/download/file/attachment/DPWG_CYP2D6_quetiapine_2393-2394-2395.pdf\\">Read for more information about this recommendation</a>, <a download=\\"CYP2D6.pdf\\" href=\\"https://api.clinpgx.org/v1/download/file/attachment/CYP2D6.pdf\\">Read about gene information from DPWG</a></p>\\n",
      "version" : 7
    },
    "version" : 10
  }
}');
