      "title" : "Pharmacogenetics of anti-cancer drugs: State of the art and implementation - recommendations of the French National Network of Pharmacogenetics.",
      "_sameAs" : "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/28262261",
      "authors" : [
        "Quaranta Sylvie",
        "Thomas Fabienne"
