      "html" : "<p>The French National Network of Pharmacogenetics (RNPGx) publication about the state of the art and clinical implementation â€” recommendations from the French National Network of Pharmacogenetics for anti-cancer drugs states:</p>\\n<blockquote class=\\"blockquote\\">\\n<p>According to the level of evidence classification of\\nthe RNPGx recommendations for pharmacogenetic testing\\n(essential, advisable, potentially useful), the level of evidence for TPMT genotyping and/or phenotyping in oncology\\nis essential.</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p><a href=\\"/page/testingGuidance\\">Read more about the RNPGx levels of recommendation for testing</a>.</p>\\n",
