    "source" : "DPWG",
    "summaryMarkdown" : {
      "id" : 1451696020,
      "html" : "<p>There are currently no recommendations for folic acid dosing based on MTHFR rs1801133 genotypes.</p>\\n",
      "version" : 0
    },
    "terms" : [],
    "textMarkdown" : {
      "id" : 1451695980,
      "html" : "<h3 id=\\"dutch-pharmacogenetics-working-group-dpwg-guideline-for-the-gene-drug-interaction-of-abcg2-hla-b-and-allopurinol-and-mthfr-folic-acid-and-methotrexate-european-journal-of-human-genetics-2022\\">Dutch pharmacogenetics working group (DPWG) guideline for the gene-drug interaction of ABCG2, HLA-B and Allopurinol, and MTHFR, folic acid and methotrexate. European journal of human genetics (2022)</h3>\\n<p>The Royal Dutch Pharmacists Association - Pharmacogenetics Working Group published a paper which reiterates that no action is required for the interaction between MTHFR and folic acid [Article:<a href=\\"/pmid/36056234\\">36056234</a>]</p>\\n<h3 id=\\"may-2021-guideline\\">May 2021 Guideline</h3>\\n<p>The Royal Dutch Pharmacists Association - Pharmacogenetics Working Group has evaluated therapeutic dose recommendations for foliumzuur and MTHFR rs1801133 (677C&gt;T) variant. They conclude that NO action is required for this gene-drug interaction.  677CT has no effect on the treatment with folic acid and 677TT either has no effect or a positive effect on the treatment with folic acid. (see <a download=\\"DPWG_May_2021.pdf\\" href=\\"https://api.clinpgx.org/v1/download/file/attachment/DPWG_May_2021.pdf\\">Dutch guidelines May 2021 update</a>).</p>\\n<p><a download=\\"DPWG_MTHFR_folic_acid_7204-7205.pdf\\" href=\\"https://api.clinpgx.org/v1/download/file/attachment/DPWG_MTHFR_folic_acid_7204-7205.pdf\\">Read for more information about this recommendation</a>, <a download=\\"MTHFR.pdf\\" href=\\"https://api.clinpgx.org/v1/download/file/attachment/MTHFR.pdf\\">Read about gene information from DPWG</a></p>\\n",
      "version" : 5
    },
    "version" : 7
  }
}');
