      "id" : 1451697946,
      "html" : "<p>There are currently no recommendations for paclitaxel dosing based on CYP3A4 genotypes.</p>\\n",
      "version" : 0
    },
    "terms" : [],
    "textMarkdown" : {
      "id" : 1451697947,
      "html" : "<h3 id=\\"may-2021-guideline\\">May 2021 Guideline</h3>\\n<p>The Royal Dutch Pharmacists Association - Pharmacogenetics Working Group has evaluated therapeutic dose recommendations for paclitaxel based on CYP3A4 genotypes. They conclude that no action is needed for this gene-drug interaction, (see <a download=\\"DPWG_May_2021.pdf\\" href=\\"https://api.clinpgx.org/v1/download/file/attachment/DPWG_May_2021.pdf\\">Dutch guidelines May 2021 update</a>).</p>\\n<p><a download=\\"DPWG_CYP3A4_paclitaxel_7107-7113.pdf\\" href=\\"https://api.clinpgx.org/v1/download/file/attachment/DPWG_CYP3A4_paclitaxel_7107-7113.pdf\\">Read for more information about this recommendation</a>, <a download=\\"CYP3A4.pdf\\" href=\\"https://api.clinpgx.org/v1/download/file/attachment/CYP3A4.pdf\\">Read about gene information from DPWG</a></p>\\n",
      "version" : 4
