    "summaryMarkdown" : {
      "id" : 1454392140,
      "html" : "<p>The SociÃ©tÃ© Francophone d''HistocompatibilitÃ© et d''ImmunogÃ©nÃ©tique (SFHI) requires testing for HLA-A*02:01 to select patients with metastatic uveal melanoma suitable for treatment with tebentafusp.</p>\\n",
